{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VBxZ2cuKnG1794311686.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>連接福建廈門至台灣金門的廈金大橋廈門段海上主線橋貫通，預計年底建成通車。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.BRIDGE-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZVXLN23jN51794312116.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>廈金大橋廈門段海上主線橋，最後一個橋段周二凌晨順利合龍，主體結構完工，進入收尾階段。廈金大橋廈門段全長19.6公里，從廈門本島起至大嶝島翔安國際機場結束，包括海上主線橋、支線橋及隧道等工程。雙向8車道，設計時速100公里。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.BRIDGE-2000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kHqHUR17u71794311704.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>廈金大橋全線規劃，分為廈門段及金門段以廈門本島為起點，跨東部海域，經大嶝島，最終目標連接台灣金門島，目前已預留往台灣金門段的接口，但由大嶝島通往金門這一段至今未獲台方同意。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.BRIDGE-2000_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SnwjKMfQsP1794314197.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:32:30.369861+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T17:15:10.434074+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:25:54.082472+00:00","content_hash":"dc19835b5bc8c6ec9618583f6d6a8206345a8b7cb617e4663e001709900c6400","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:32:30.369861+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}